{"words": [{"text": "وَهَـٰذَا", "translation": "And this"}, {"text": "كِتَـٰبٌ", "translation": "(is) a Book"}, {"text": "أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ", "translation": "We have revealed it"}, {"text": "مُبَارَكٌۭ", "translation": "blessed"}, {"text": "مُّصَدِّقُ", "translation": "confirming"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "which"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "(came) before"}, {"text": "يَدَيْهِ", "translation": "its hands"}, {"text": "وَلِتُنذِرَ", "translation": "so that you may warn"}, {"text": "أُمَّ", "translation": "(the) mother"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُرَىٰ", "translation": "(of) the cities"}, {"text": "وَمَنْ", "translation": "and who"}, {"text": "حَوْلَهَا ۚ", "translation": "(are) around it"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those who"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "translation": "in the Hereafter"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "they believe"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "and they"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "صَلَاتِهِمْ", "translation": "their prayers"}, {"text": "يُحَافِظُونَ", "translation": "(are) guarding"}], "sahih": "And this is a Book which We have sent down, blessed and confirming what was before it, that you may warn the Mother of Cities [i.e., Makkah] and those around it.1 Those who believe in the Hereafter believe in it, and they are maintaining their prayers."}